 -- AX25Chat Community <noreply@ax25chat.invalid>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 05:04:26 +0000

ax25chat (1.6.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Android: the modem and the APRS-IS connection still died with the phone
    locked. Cause found by comparing with APRSdroid: Qt for Android suspends
    the application's event loop off screen unless the manifest sets
    android.app.background_running to true, so every timer, socket and queued
    signal on the Qt thread stopped at the lock. The generated manifest sets
    it; the foreground service falls back on the specialUse type as APRSdroid
    does; the APRS-IS socket carries TCP keepalive.

 -- AX25Chat Community <noreply@ax25chat.invalid>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 15:32:21 +0000

